              "type": "text",
              "content": "Notice that the percentage of flowers that bloomed in summer is more in Fatima’s garden but this doesn’t say anything about the actual number — Fatima’s garden has more blooms than Naveen’s in summer in Case 1 but her garden has fewer blooms than his in Case 2. Also, in Case 1 both Fatima’s and Naveen’s garden had 42 blooms but the respective percentages are different."
